\\helpers\\VarDumper;\n\n/* @var $this View */\nmt_srand(time());\n$name = mt_rand(1111, 9999);\n$auth1 = new PhpManager([\n    'itemFile' => '@runtime/rbac-items.php'\n    ]);\n\n$auth1->removeAll();\n$item = $auth1->createRole($name);\n$auth1->add($item);\n\n// load from other manager\n$auth2 = new PhpManager([\n    'itemFile' => '@runtime/rbac-items.php'\n    ]);\n\nVarDumper::dump([\n    'auth1' => $auth1->getRoles(),\n    'auth2' => $auth2->getRoles()\n    ], 10, true);\n```\n\nBoth `authManager` have a different value.\n![screenshot from 2016-03-13 22 42 39](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/5828252/13729673/35adf872-e96d-11e5-84d5-891a267d2d82.png)\n\nEven after redirecting. When redirect to other page, latest item added can not be loaded at first time.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/11106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/11106/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]